        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Ace, TextMate\n- Organizations: Ajax.org, Cloud9\n- People: Allan Odgaard\n- Concepts: web-based code editors, native editor features, usability, performance\n\nFacts:\n- Ace is a standalone code editor written in JavaScript.\n- Ace comes from Ajax.org Cloud9 Editor.\n- Ace aims to create a web-based code editor that matches and extends the features, usability, and performance of native editors.\n- Ace compares its goals to native editors such as TextMate, Vim, and Eclipse.\n- TextMate is a general-purpose GUI text editor for Mac OS X.\n- Allan Odgaard created TextMate.",
